async isSignedInt64Odd no
purpose operation isSignedInt64Odd "Returns true when inputValue % 2 != 0."
guarantee isSignedInt64Odd "Total."
label startIsSignedInt64Odd
storage module immutable zeroO I64 0
storage module immutable twoO I64 2
storage module immutable trueO Bool true
storage module immutable falseO Bool false
call modOCall math.moduloI64
argument modOCall left I64 inputValue
argument modOCall right I64 twoO
run modOCall
bind value modO I64 modOCall
call neZeroOCall math.notEqualI64
argument neZeroOCall left I64 modO
argument neZeroOCall right I64 zeroO
run neZeroOCall
bind value neZeroO Bool neZeroOCall
branch if condition neZeroO target isOddTrue
