operation countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64
input operation countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 inputValue CSignedInt64
output operation countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 CSignedInt64
memory countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 heap no
async countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 no
purpose operation countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 "Returns the count of leading zero bits in inputValue's 64-bit representation. Returns 64 for inputValue == 0; returns 0 for negative values (sign bit 63 is set)."
invariant operation countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 "Probe descends from 2^62 (the largest power of two representable as a positive CSignedInt64). For positive inputs we add 1 to account for the unrepresentable sign bit 63 above the probe range."
guarantee countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 "Total â€” in [0, 64]."
label startCountLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64
storage module immutable zeroClz I64 0
storage module immutable oneClz I64 1
storage module immutable twoClz I64 2
storage module immutable sixtyFourClz I64 64
# Negative inputs have bit 63 set, so zero leading zeros.
call clzIsNegativeCall math.lessThanI64
argument clzIsNegativeCall left I64 inputValue
argument clzIsNegativeCall right I64 zeroClz
run clzIsNegativeCall
bind value clzIsNegativeResult Bool clzIsNegativeCall
branch if condition clzIsNegativeResult target clzReturnZero
call eqZeroClzCall math.equalI64
argument eqZeroClzCall left I64 inputValue
argument eqZeroClzCall right I64 zeroClz
run eqZeroClzCall
bind value nIsZero Bool eqZeroClzCall
branch if condition nIsZero target clzReturn64
# Probe = high bit shift down until we find the topmost set bit.
# Start with highest power of two we can represent without overflow.
storage module immutable probeStart I64 4611686018427387904
memory countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 mutable probe I64 0
set memory probe probeStart
memory countLeadingZeroBitsInSignedInt64 mutable clzCount I64 0
label clzLoop
call clzProbeLessEqualCall math.lessThanOrEqualI64
argument clzProbeLessEqualCall left I64 probe
argument clzProbeLessEqualCall right I64 inputValue
run clzProbeLessEqualCall
bind value clzProbeLessEqualCallN Bool clzProbeLessEqualCall
branch if condition clzProbeLessEqualCallN target clzDone
call clzIncrementCall math.addI64
argument clzIncrementCall left I64 clzCount
argument clzIncrementCall right I64 oneClz
run clzIncrementCall
bind value clzNext I64 clzIncrementCall
set memory clzCount clzNext
call clzProbeHalfCall math.divideI64
argument clzProbeHalfCall left I64 probe
argument clzProbeHalfCall right I64 twoClz
run clzProbeHalfCall
bind value probeNext I64 clzProbeHalfCall
set memory probe probeNext
call clzProbeZeroCall math.equalI64
argument clzProbeZeroCall left I64 probe
argument clzProbeZeroCall right I64 zeroClz
run clzProbeZeroCall
bind value probeIsZero Bool clzProbeZeroCall
branch if condition probeIsZero target clzReturn64
branch else target clzLoop
label clzDone
# Add 1 to count for the unrepresentable bit 63 above probeStart's bit 62.
call clzAdjustCall math.addI64
argument clzAdjustCall left I64 clzCount
argument clzAdjustCall right I64 oneClz
run clzAdjustCall
bind value clzCountAdjusted I64 clzAdjustCall
return value clzCountAdjusted
label clzReturn64
return value sixtyFourClz
label clzReturnZero
return value zeroClz

operation squareSignedInt64
input operation squareSignedInt64 inputValue CSignedInt64
output operation squareSignedInt64 CSignedInt64
memory squareSignedInt64 heap no
async squareSignedInt64 no
purpose operation squareSignedInt64 "Returns inputValue * inputValue."
warning squareSignedInt64 "Wraps modulo 2^64 on overflow."
guarantee squareSignedInt64 "Total."
label startSquareSignedInt64
call sqCall math.multiplyI64
argument sqCall left I64 inputValue
argument sqCall right I64 inputValue
run sqCall
bind value squareResult CSignedInt64 sqCall
return value squareResult

operation cubeSignedInt64
input operation cubeSignedInt64 inputValue CSignedInt64
output operation cubeSignedInt64 CSignedInt64
memory cubeSignedInt64 heap no
async cubeSignedInt64 no
purpose operation cubeSignedInt64 "Returns inputValue * inputValue * inputValue."
warning cubeSignedInt64 "Wraps modulo 2^64 on overflow."
guarantee cubeSignedInt64 "Total."
label startCubeSignedInt64
call cubeSquareStepCall math.multiplyI64
argument cubeSquareStepCall left I64 inputValue
argument cubeSquareStepCall right I64 inputValue
run cubeSquareStepCall
bind value squareIntermediate CSignedInt64 cubeSquareStepCall
call cubeMultiplyStepCall math.multiplyI64
argument cubeMultiplyStepCall left I64 squareIntermediate
argument cubeMultiplyStepCall right I64 inputValue
run cubeMultiplyStepCall
bind value cubeResult CSignedInt64 cubeMultiplyStepCall
return value cubeResult

operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange
input operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange inputValue CSignedInt64
input operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange lowerBound CSignedInt64
input operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange upperBound CSignedInt64
output operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange Bool
memory isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange heap no
async isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange no
purpose operation isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange "Returns true when lowerBound <= inputValue <= upperBound."
guarantee isSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange "Total."
label startIsSignedInt64WithinInclusiveRange
storage module immutable trueIR Bool true
storage module immutable falseIR Bool false
call clampBelowLowerCall math.lessThanI64
argument clampBelowLowerCall left I64 inputValue
argument clampBelowLowerCall right I64 lowerBound
run clampBelowLowerCall
bind value belowLowerBound Bool clampBelowLowerCall
branch if condition belowLowerBound target irFalse
call clampAboveUpperCall math.greaterThanI64
argument clampAboveUpperCall left I64 inputValue
argument clampAboveUpperCall right I64 upperBound
run clampAboveUpperCall
bind value aboveUpperBound Bool clampAboveUpperCall
branch if condition aboveUpperBound target irFalse
return value trueIR
label irFalse
return value falseIR

